InsightFace "buffalo_l" model pack
----------------------------------
Files:    /root/.insightface/models/buffalo_l/*.onnx
          (det_10g, 2d106det, 1k3d68, genderage, w600k_r50)
Used for: face detection and landmark alignment. suslik's default recognition
          model is AdaFace (see below); the buffalo recognition head is only
          loaded when `modell: buffalo` is configured.
Project:  https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface
Authors:  Jia Guo, Jiankang Deng and the InsightFace contributors

The InsightFace *code* is MIT-licensed. The pre-trained *models* are not. The
project states, verbatim (model_zoo/README.md, retrieved 2026-07-25):

    "ALL models are available for non-commercial research purposes only."

and in its root README:

    "The training data containing the annotation (and the models trained with
     these data) are available for non-commercial research purposes only."

For commercial licensing of the buffalo_l pack, InsightFace names this contact:
recognition-oss-pack@insightface.ai

If you require a permissive detection model, InsightFace's terms are the reason
to replace this component rather than to ignore them.


